    "scope": "D17: accepted regressions of L01.4/L08.1/L08.6/L08.7/L11.5/L12.4/L16.2/L14.5. Historical receipts locate recipes, never prove the current candidate. L08.1 replays the Linux grid; macOS is supplementary historical evidence only. L11.5 is a documentary D5 fallback with grid — and no native cell. Existing OS/population and identity guards are preserved.",
    "unselected_cells": {
      "windows": "L01.4 recipe accepted on Windows 11; L08.1/L08.6/L08.7/L12.4/L16.2/L14.5 have no accepted selectable Windows recipe and remain NON_PROUVÉ. L11.5 has grid — and no native cell. Windows 10 is deferred.",
      "macos": "L01.4/L08.7 recipes only. L08.1 has a Linux grid; its historical macOS supplement is not a selectable grid cell. L08.6/L12.4/L16.2/L14.5 remain NON_PROUVÉ on macOS. L11.5 has grid — and no native cell."
